    sw: 'Carbon steel that was not stress relieved (no PWHT) cracks at welds in caustic, especially when warm.',
    why: 'Caustic (NaOH / KOH), temperature above ~45 °C (concentration-dependent), no PWHT.', who: 'Caustic tanks and lines, caustic treating, steam-traced caustic.', look: 'Fine branched cracks near welds.', find: 'WFMT, PT, UT / PAUT.', stop: 'PWHT of carbon steel, avoid hot caustic.',
